[COMMENTS]
STATION,Velocity area station gauging a coastal catchment in North Scotland. GENERAL: Open channel section with gravel control. Station added to peak flows dataset in October 2018 (WINFAP Files v7). STATION HYDROMETRY: No cableway. Gauged to AMAX1, all flows contained (bankfull is greater than AMAX1). Multiple peak flow ratings across period of record.
CATCHMENT,Upper coastal catchment. Arable, pasture, rough grazing, some forestry.
Qmed Suitability,Gauged to AMAX 1.
Pooling Suitability,Gauged to AMAX 1.
